pyaigis-kr is a Korea-focused fork of pyaigis maintained at
https://github.com/gaebalai/aigis-kr. It preserves the upstream API and
behavior while adding:

  - 53-item Korean regulation compliance mapping (PIPA, 신용정보법,
    정보통신망법, 금융위 AI 가이드라인, 전자금융감독규정, ISMS-P)
  - Korean financial and identity PII detectors (10 patterns)
  - Korean prompt-injection patterns (11 patterns)
  - Hangul jamo-split / NFKC normalization
  - kr_finance / kr_pipa / kr_isms_p policy templates
  - Python (CLI / HTTP server) and frontend (site, dashboard) Korean i18n

Upstream changes are merged on a best-effort basis. The intended path is
that Korean additions are eventually upstreamed; until then this fork is
the publishing channel for the Korean compliance layer.
